  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "地牛péng花蓮"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>作者：</b></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>蘇晏德</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">2024年4月初3花蓮大地動</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">發生tī清明ê前一工</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">夜生活ê人iáu teh做夢</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">7點58地牛掠狂teh tín動</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">規模7.2　一目nih厝倒山崩</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">幌碎花蓮人連假ê希望</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">4月初3趕beh上班hit一工</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台灣人hō͘你幌kah茫茫茫</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阮tī塗堆走揣親人</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">啥人體會阮ê苦thàng</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">耶穌求你tàu-saⁿ-kāng</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">上帝請你kā阮tàu幫忙</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Lán人2月25是炎熱ê天氣</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台灣ê天頂ná像六月天</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">幸運活--leh ê人無歡喜</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">不幸ê人真傷悲</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Ǹg望天mài kā阮創治</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Hō͘失蹤ê人緊kah阮團圓</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">早起7點58 iáu未出門</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台灣全島ná像搖kô床</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">地牛大聲teh sio借問</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">鄉親--啊　lín kám有食早頓</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台灣人心酸掛心腸</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">規模7.2搖kah蘇花公路斷</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">花蓮人驚惶心酸酸</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Beh tńg--去ê路哪ē chiah-nī遠</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><a name='more'></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg3lDrz07iXNETgO4YEHiLcwqQUE7TfhfNXdnLGIAMMw9xqig6w45AUWX2W9Msh031XWG6v7jzC8qWaj2d9o2NFptFZCENfoA5T6YhoQtI85x3SQ2HkEIbGCtsy4Bka_ZUckGLhp55STXZ93Cl9il9aqEw9As0kea7ZfyVCfq73Cl6g0pCeHm0siThSJcMM/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1362%E6%9C%9F_47.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg3lDrz07iXNETgO4YEHiLcwqQUE7TfhfNXdnLGIAMMw9xqig6w45AUWX2W9Msh031XWG6v7jzC8qWaj2d9o2NFptFZCENfoA5T6YhoQtI85x3SQ2HkEIbGCtsy4Bka_ZUckGLhp55STXZ93Cl9il9aqEw9As0kea7ZfyVCfq73Cl6g0pCeHm0siThSJcMM/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1362%E6%9C%9F_47.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><p><span></span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgr5b7g89EJzWaZej0x81gbwHN1k5wpIdOIpOF1PqE7wmKgZnJBE3lK4MifxxtNeLI3nwZK6phuK7k_YUgpfhan02noOhsnyDVnbf2D8FePOLPfSFMwXyfnx8jVOZ33e6z40aEJZnWj78K46Ja0XkCr8lzCObzRJto3hcOzPj6s_nwVo6m-mX9SRbrHAfs1/s1424/362%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgr5b7g89EJzWaZej0x81gbwHN1k5wpIdOIpOF1PqE7wmKgZnJBE3lK4MifxxtNeLI3nwZK6phuK7k_YUgpfhan02noOhsnyDVnbf2D8FePOLPfSFMwXyfnx8jVOZ33e6z40aEJZnWj78K46Ja0XkCr8lzCObzRJto3hcOzPj6s_nwVo6m-mX9SRbrHAfs1/w450-h640/362%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>#做伙來唸詩 專欄，本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap傳統白話字。</b><br /><br /></span></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl gpro0wi8 q66pz984 b1v8xokw\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/%E5%8F%B